# Large, reproducible-from-public-sources training datasets.
# data/cauren_civil/ stays tracked (it's a tiny bundled example); the
# real bridge dataset built from FHWA/USGS/FEMA sources is ~1.5GB and
# regenerable, so it doesn't belong in git. See data/cauren_bridge/dataset_summary.json
# for provenance and tools/ for the (re)build path.
data/cauren_bridge/
